  "advancement.mineraculouskamikotizations.kamikotization.transform_weather_control.desc": "Show the world who the best weather player really is...",
  "advancement.mineraculouskamikotizations.kamikotization.transform_weather_control.title": "Grab an Umbrella",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.description": "Powers to control the weather",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.ice.text": "The Ice mode will fire Ice Charges that freeze entities and blocks that they hit.\nWhen frozen, entities will be captured in a prison of ice and will freeze to death.\n",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.ice.title": "Ice",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.lightning.text": "The Lightning mode will summon Lightning Bolts at the targeted entity or block, damaging them and lighting fires in the process.\n",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.lightning.title": "Lightning",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.name": "Weather Control",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.overview.text": "The Weather Control kamikotization grants the receiver the power over weather and storms.\nIts tool is the Weather Control Parasol.\nThis kamikotization can be applied to any umbrella by default, including those from other mods (as long as they are in the 'c:tools/umbrella' tag).\n",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.overview.title": "Overview",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.tool.text": "The Weather Control Parasol has four tool modes:\n- Ice\n- Lightning\n- Weather\n- Wind\n\nWhen in any equipment slot, the holder is granted creative flight and reduced fall damage. When open and actively used, the holder will fall slowly.\n",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.tool.title": "Tool",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.weather.text": "The Weather mode will cycle the weather through rain, thunder, and clear.\n",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.weather.title": "Weather",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.wind.text": "The Wind mode will fire Wind Charges that will push entities and blocks that they hit.\n",
  "book.mineraculous.wiki.kamikotizations.weather_control.wind.title": "Wind",
